  "syncCenter.help.title": "How do I use synchronization?",
  "syncCenter.help.sectionLocal": "Local Export / Import",
  "syncCenter.help.local.step1": "Choose the “Local Export / Import” block from the list.",
  "syncCenter.help.local.step2": "Tap “Export ENTIRE store” to save all your stats, or “Export active profile” to save only one profile.",
  "syncCenter.help.local.step3": "The JSON appears in the top field. You can copy/paste it, or tap “Download (.dcstats.json)” to get a file.",
  "syncCenter.help.local.step4": "On another device: open this same page, go to “Local Export / Import”, paste the JSON into the field OR tap “Choose a file” to import the .dcstats.json file.",
  "syncCenter.help.local.step5": "Tap “Import JSON”. When it is finished, restart the app to reload all data cleanly.",
  "syncCenter.help.sectionPeer": "Direct sync with a friend (device to device)",
  "syncCenter.help.peer.step1": "On the device SENDING the profile: choose the “Direct sync with a friend” block.",
  "syncCenter.help.peer.step2": "Tap “Generate sync payload”. The target profile (active profile or one passed in parameters) is converted to JSON.",
  "syncCenter.help.peer.step3": "To share it: tap “Copy for sharing” to send the JSON by message, or “Show QR” to generate a QR Code for your friend.",
  "syncCenter.help.peer.step4": "On the RECEIVING device: open this page, go to “Direct sync with a friend”, then tap “Scan a QR” and aim at the QR shown on the first device.",
  "syncCenter.help.peer.step5": "The profile is imported automatically. You can also paste the received JSON into the “Generated payload” field and tap “Import this payload”.",
  "syncCenter.help.sectionCloud": "Cloud Sync (code)",
  "syncCenter.help.cloud.step1": "On the source device: choose “Cloud Sync (code)” then tap “Send snapshot”.",
  "syncCenter.help.cloud.step2": "A sync code is generated (e.g. 7FQ9-L2KD-8ZP3). Write it down or send it to your other device.",
  "syncCenter.help.cloud.step3": "On the target device: open “Cloud Sync (code)”, enter the received code, then tap “Retrieve with this code”.",
  "syncCenter.help.cloud.step4": "When retrieval is finished, restart the app to reload all synchronized stats.",
  "syncCenter.help.tip": "Tip: after any import (local, QR or cloud), restarting the app ensures all stats and profiles are fully up to date.",
